# tally 2.1.8 R16(d), #183 (B2 of group 3's review, agent/t17; pick P39): late, a decision on 03-01, reads
# bal(konto, 2026-03-31) from its day; early ran earlier on 03-01 with a leg of 100.00 on 03-10. A projection from a
# point of day t counts the legs, dated t through d, of a decision that ran earlier on day t (L §5.14.1, E §4.3
# step 2): late tops konto up by 400.00, a 500.00 DUK. 892b90d8 left early's leg out: 600.00.
=== m.tally
model p
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "probe"
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts DUK lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts DUK lives 2026-01-01..
input amt: money DUK
input floor: money DUK
input d_mv: date
input d_leg: date
input d_late: date
input d_to: date
move early: transfers
  on d_mv
  reads sav
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt + bal(sav) on d_leg
move late: transfers
  on d_late
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount max(0 DUK, floor - bal(konto, d_to) from d_late)
ask a: bal(konto, 2026-03-31), bal(konto, 2026-03-01), bal(konto, 2026-02-28)
ask b: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) from 2026-02-01, bal(konto, 2026-03-31) from 2026-03-01
version v
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 DUK "c"
  floor = 500.00 DUK "c"
  d_mv = 2026-03-01 "c"
  d_leg = 2026-03-10 "c"
  d_late = 2026-03-01 "c"
  d_to = 2026-03-31 "c"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 DUK at 2026-01-01 start "c"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 DUK at 2026-01-01 start "c"
=== expect
a: (500.00 DUK, 400.00 DUK, 0.00 DUK)
  left out: late, 1 instances, first 2026-03-01
  cut 2026-01-01
b: (500.00 DUK, 500.00 DUK)
  left out: late, 1 instances, first 2026-03-01
  cut 2026-01-01
